sequenceDiagram
    participant Bootstrap as Bootstrap.main
    participant Catalina as Catalina
    participant Context as StandardContext
    participant Scanner as PackageScanner
    participant IoC as SimpleApplicationContext
    participant Dispatcher as DispatcherServlet

    Bootstrap->>Catalina: new & start()
    activate Catalina
    Catalina->>Context: new & addChild()
    Note over Context: 设置 contextPath, docBase
    Context->>Context: 初始化 WebappClassLoader
    Catalina->>Dispatcher: 创建并注册 Servlet
    Note over Dispatcher: 对应 web.xml 配置

    Context->>Dispatcher: init()
    activate Dispatcher
    Dispatcher->>Scanner: 扫描包 (scan.packages)
    Scanner-->>Dispatcher: 返回 Class 集合
    Dispatcher->>IoC: 实例化 Bean (扫描 @Controller等)
    IoC->>IoC: 依赖注入 (@Autowired)
    Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: 建立 URL-Handler 映射
    deactivate Dispatcher

    Catalina->>Catalina: start() -> Connector 监听端口
    deactivate Catalina
    Note over Bootstrap,Dispatcher: ★ 启动阶段 (类似 Spring Boot) ★

    Note over Dispatcher,Client: ★ 运行时阶段 ★
    Client->>Connector: HTTP 请求
    Connector->>Dispatcher: 处理请求
    Dispatcher->>Handler: 调用业务方法
    Handler->>IoC: 获取依赖的 Service/Repository
    Handler-->>Dispatcher: 返回结果
    Dispatcher->>Response: 封装 JSON/HTML
    Response-->>Client: HTTP 响应